<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES SCORE 217 FOR EIGHT V AUSTRALIA A.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES SCORE 217 FOR EIGHT V AUSTRALIA A.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies scored 217 for eight in 50 overs in a one-day tour match against Australia A at the Melbourne Cricket Ground on Friday.</p>
<p>Score - West Indies 217 for eight (Shivnarine Chanderpaul 72) v Australia A.</p>
</text>
